# Telos, the old military base after the reactor (TSL, 232TEL): the
# reactor room's turrets, the droid recharging station's security door
# (Bao-Dur's Security) and its footlocker's datapad (the shuttle's codes),
# the bay control room (Bao-Dur's Security on its door) and its console
# opening the hangar doors, the tank droid let out at the shuttle, and the
# shuttle to the shielded mesa at the pole (the HK-50s' scene after). Starts
# from the reactor's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @telos_reactor data/routes/tsl/telos_base_shuttle.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Old Military Base" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
fight 30             # the reactor room's turrets, hostile now
leader 1             # back to the recharging station, its lower doors open
unlock TelosDoor3@3  # now: Bao-Dur's Security on its security door
leader player
use CivilFootLkerS   # the footlocker's datapad: the shuttle's codes
use MetalBoxP@2      # and the metal box beside it
fight 40             # its droids
leader 1             # the bay control room by the shuttle: Bao-Dur's
unlock Door_BC       # Security on its door
leader player
say Unlock hangar doors # its console: the hangar doors unlocked
use TermB
talk
fight 60             # the tank droid let out of its room at the shuttle
say Take the shuttle # the shuttle to the shielded mesa at the pole
# BLOCKER: out of the bay control room by its door and the corridor's
# force fields, not across the barrels in its south doorway: the walk's
# navigation mesh tags a face under a placeable's footprint only when most
# of the face is, so the way between those barrels' footprints (shut to
# KOTOR's walker) is planned and the walk wedges there.
to TelosDoor2@7
to TelosDoor2@6
to tr_shuttle_launch # the shuttle's scene, the tank droid fallen
talk
talk                 # the HK-50s at the bay control: one sent to the pole
module 261tel        # shot down on the polar plateau
save telos_polar
